ATTRIBUTION

This project is an adaptation of the llm-council skill
(https://github.com/tenfoldmarc/llm-council-skill), which is MIT licensed, and
of the LLM Council methodology described by Andrej Karpathy
(https://x.com/karpathy/status/1962263486196867115).

The council structure, blind peer review and chairman synthesis derive from
that prior work. The six-advisor marketing roster, the intake gate, the
numeric scoring, the budget reallocation round, the measurement gate and the
four-way verdict are additions specific to this project.
